      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Included articles: 1) were published in peer-reviewed journals; 2) were written in English; 3) used system dynamics modeling (i.e., causal-loop diagramming, stock-and-flow diagramming, or computational system dynamics modeling); 4) pertained to cancer prevention or control; and 4) were published within the last 10 years.",
      "reason": "The review explicitly lists the inclusion criteria for study design (system dynamics modeling), topic (cancer prevention or control), and publication characteristics."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Included articles: 1) were published in peer-reviewed journals; 2) were written in English; ... 4) were published within the last 10 years.",
      "reason": "The review specifies criteria for publication status (peer-reviewed journals), language (English), and dissemination year (last 10 years)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "This is a systematic review of modeling studies, not a clinical intervention review where the distinction between outcomes not measured versus not reported is a standard exclusion criterion."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "As shown in Fig 1, most studies included a computational system dynamics simulation model (n = 21; 66%), while the remaining studies (n = 11; 34%) used only diagramming approaches (referred to as diagram-only studies in this review).",
      "reason": "The review specifies the grouping of studies into 'simulation' and 'diagram-only' approaches for the purpose of synthesis and comparison."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "This search period was selected to reflect recent developments and current applications of system dynamics modeling related to cancer.",
      "reason": "The review provides a rationale for the restriction on the publication date (last 10 years)."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
}

